flowchart TB
  D[POST /incidents/id/decision<br/>reviewer = JWT sub] --> G[agent.get → proposed action, target]
  G --> Q{approved and<br/>action ≠ escalate?}
  Q -->|yes| M[mint capability<br/>tenant · incident · action · target · approver · jti · 5 min]
  Q -->|no| N[no capability]
  M --> A[agent.decide + X-Sentinel-Remediation-Token]
  N --> A
  A --> U[incidents.update: status, execution,<br/>verification, timeline, TTM]
  U --> E{view has execution?}
  E -->|yes| AU[INSERT remediation_audit<br/>with capability jti]
  E -->|no| F
  AU --> F{status final?<br/>RESOLVED · CLOSED_NO_ACTION · FAILED}
  F -->|yes| R[release alert links<br/>a recurrence opens a new incident]
  F -->|no: REMEDIATION_FAILED · ESCALATED| K[keep alert linked<br/>the problem isn't over]
